<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Offerings — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f7fffb;--primary:#2b9f7b;--muted:#5b6b6b}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial;color:#123;margin:background-color:var(--bg);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fff);min-height:100vh}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 26px}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:#123;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .container{max-width:980px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .lead{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted)}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:22px}
    .card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(12,18,20,0.06)}
    .service{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f4f6f6}
    .service:last-child{border-bottom:none}
    .meta{color:var(--muted)}
    .price{font-weight:800;font-size:20px;color:var(--primary)}
    /* Toggle */
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;padding:6px;background:#eef6f2;border-radius:999px;gap:6px}
    .toggle button{border:0;background:transparent;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer}
    .toggle button.active{background:var(--primary);color:#fff}
    .footnote{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:12px}
    .svgpattern{position:absolute;left:-40px;bottom:20px;width:260px;height:260px;opacity:.06}
    @media (max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.svgpattern{display:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <svg class="svgpattern" viewBox="0 0 300 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden>
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="g2" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#eafff3"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#fff"/></linearGradient>
      <pattern id="p2" width="60" height="60" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <rect width="60" height="60" fill="url(#g2)"/>
        <path d="M0 30h60" stroke="#d7f0e3" stroke-width="2"/>
        <circle cx="45" cy="15" r="3" fill="#c8eedf"/>
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p2)" rx="30"/>
  </svg>

  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
      <a href="index.html" style="font-weight:800;color:#123;text-decoration:none">Start</a>
      <nav aria-label="Main nav">
        <a href="about.html">Origins</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Pathways</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div>
      <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="background:var(--primary);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <h1>Offerings framed around outcomes</h1>
    <p class="lead">Sessions and group experiences designed to help you land a habit, sustain momentum, and scale it into your routine.</p>

    <section style="margin-top:20px" class="grid">
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div>
              <strong>Service lineup</strong>
              <div class="meta">Pick the rhythm: single sessions, rolling coaching, or compact packages</div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Price toggle">
                <button class="priceToggle active" data-mode="monthly">Monthly</button>
                <button class="priceToggle" data-mode="package">Package</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <div class="service">
              <div>
                <div style="font-weight:800">Habit Design Session</div>
                <div class="meta">90-minute planning session</div>
              </div>
              <div class="price" data-month="129" data-package="450">$<span class="num">129</span></div>
            </div>

            <div class="service">
              <div>
                <div style="font-weight:800">Momentum Circle</div>
                <div class="meta">Weekly group coaching + accountability</div>
              </div>
              <div class="price" data-month="49" data-package="320">$<span class="num">49</span>/mo</div>
            </div>

            <div class="service">
              <div>
                <div style="font-weight:800">Weekend Reset</div>
                <div class="meta">Compact in-person or virtual intensive</div>
              </div>
              <div class="price" data-month="199" data-package="740">$<span class="num">199</span></div>
            </div>

          </div>

          <div class="footnote">Prices animate between views. Packages show typical bundled cost; monthly shows subscription-style rates.</div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:18px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <strong>How to choose</strong>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">If you want a quick reset, start with a session. If you need ongoing nudges, consider a rolling monthly plan. Packages are best when you commit to a three-month run.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <strong>Need help deciding?</strong>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Try the short quiz on the Pathways page or book a 20-minute clarity call.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="display:inline-block;background:var(--primary);color:#fff;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:18px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <strong>Local info</strong>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Located in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — virtual sessions available.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

  </main>

  <script>
    // Pricing comparator with animated numbers
    const toggles = document.querySelectorAll('.priceToggle');
    const priceEls = document.querySelectorAll('.price');
    let mode = 'monthly';

    function animateValue(el, start, end, duration){
      const span = el.querySelector('.num');
      const startTime = performance.now();
      function step(now){
        const t = Math.min(1,(now-startTime)/duration);
        const value = Math.round(start + (end-start)*t);
        span.textContent = value;
        if(t<1) requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(step);
    }

    function setMode(newMode){
      if(mode===newMode) return; mode = newMode;
      document.querySelectorAll('.priceToggle').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active', b.dataset.mode===mode));
      priceEls.forEach(el=>{
        const from = parseInt(el.querySelector('.num').textContent,10)||0;
        const to = parseInt(el.dataset[newMode],10);
        animateValue(el, from, to, 420);
        // suffix for monthly items
        if(newMode==='monthly') el.innerHTML = '$<span class="num">'+to+'</span>' + (el.dataset[newMode]==='49'?'/mo':'');
        else el.innerHTML = '$<span class="num">'+from+'</span>';
        // ensure structure: reassign num after animation final
        setTimeout(()=>{ el.innerHTML = '$<span class="num">'+to+'</span>' + (newMode==='monthly' && el.dataset.month==='49'?'/mo':''); }, 430);
      });
    }

    toggles.forEach(btn=>btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>setMode(btn.dataset.mode)));

    // initialize DOM with data-month values
    priceEls.forEach(el=>{
      const m = el.dataset.month; const p = el.dataset.package;
      el.innerHTML = '$<span class="num">'+m+'</span>' + (m==='49'?'/mo':'');
    });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"programs.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Pathways — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#6b63ff;--bg:#fffafc;--muted:#5a5f66}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial;background:var(--bg);color:#222}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 24px}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:#222;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:20px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .intro{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start}
    .intro .txt{flex:1}
    .panel{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(16,22,26,0.06)}
    .program{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px dashed #f1f2f4;padding:12px 0}
    .program:last-child{border-bottom:none}
    .price{font-weight:900;color:var(--accent)}
    .controls{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .modeBtn{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #f0eefb;background:#fff;cursor:pointer}
    .modeBtn.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}
    .moodline{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
    .moodBtn{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #f4f4f6;cursor:pointer}
    .moodBtn.active{background:#f4f2ff;border-color:rgba(107,99,255,0.18)}
    .heroSvg{position:fixed;right:10px;top:60px;width:220px;height:220px;opacity:.04}
    @media (max-width:900px){.intro{flex-direction:column}.heroSvg{display:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <svg class="heroSvg" viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden>
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="gg" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#f0e9ff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#fff"/></linearGradient>
      <pattern id="pp" width="50" height="50" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <rect width="50" height="50" fill="url(#gg)"/>
        <path d="M0 25h50" stroke="#ece8ff" stroke-width="2"/>
        <circle cx="12" cy="38" r="3" fill="#e9e3ff"/>
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#pp)" rx="20"/>
  </svg>

  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
      <a href="index.html" style="font-weight:800;color:#222;text-decoration:none">Start</a>
      <nav aria-label="Main nav">
        <a href="about.html">Origins</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Pathways</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div>
      <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="intro">
      <div class="txt">
        <h1>Structured paths that meet you where you are</h1>
        <p style="color:var(--muted)">Choose a guided path: short experiments, multi-month sprints, or community-powered rhythms. Each pathway focuses on habits, outcomes, and simple feedback loops.</p>

        <div style="margin-top:12px" class="panel">
          <strong>Find the right path</strong>
          <div class="moodline" role="tablist">
            <button class="moodBtn active" data-key="overwhelmed">Overwhelmed</button>
            <button class="moodBtn" data-key="stuck">Stalled</button>
            <button class="moodBtn" data-key="ready">Ambitious</button>
            <button class="moodBtn" data-key="curious">Curious</button>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div id="pathRec" style="max-width:66%">
              <div style="font-weight:800" id="pathTitle">Three-week Stabilizer</div>
              <div id="pathText" style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">A compact cycle focused on clearing immediate friction and landing 2 sustainable habits.</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <a id="pathCta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="padding:10px 12px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700">Begin Stabilizer</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside style="width:320px">
        <div class="panel">
          <strong>Programs</strong>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Three curated tracks: Stabilizer, Momentum Sprint, and Habit Foundry.</p>

          <div style="margin-top:12px" class="controls">
            <button class="modeBtn active" data-mode="monthly">Monthly view</button>
            <button class="modeBtn" data-mode="package">Package view</button>
          </div>

        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px">
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="program">
